# Pairs with RevocationTakesEffect. A rebuild that regains authority without
# reading the registry re-trusts the snapshot the push invalidated.
MODULE: RebuildKeepsOldSnapshot
TARGET: RevocationTakesEffect
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: once compiled, the rebuild regains authority over the snapshot it already held
PERTURBS: Rebuild

--- FIND
    /\ seen' = grant
--- REPLACE
    /\ seen' = IF seen.ex THEN seen ELSE grant
--- END